    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-11" id="fn-11" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">Balance includes $673,095 of OBA with an associated company.</span>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-12" id="fn-12" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">Balance includes $1,058,603 of OBA with an associated company.</span>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-13" id="fn-13" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">Balance includes $4,339,710 of operating leases with a lease term in excess of 12 months recognized as right of use assets recorded to Account 101.1 Property under capital leases. See</span>
        <span style="color:#0000ff;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;text-decoration:underline">
          <a style="color:#0000ff;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;text-decoration:underline" href="#idb67926889eb4debb08da64b18206630_28">Note 2 - Net Utility Plant</a>
        </span>
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">.</span>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-14" id="fn-14" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">Balance includes $4,400,210 of operating leases with a lease term in excess of 12 months recognized as right of use assets recorded to Account 101.1 Property under capital leases. See</span>
        <span style="color:#0000ff;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;text-decoration:underline">
          <a style="color:#0000ff;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;text-decoration:underline" href="#idb67926889eb4debb08da64b18206630_28">Note 2 - Net Utility Plant</a>
        </span>
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">.</span>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-15" id="fn-15" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:112%">Cheniere Creole Trail Pipeline, L.P. does not issue its own debt. Utilizing the average debt ratio and equity ratio based on a proxy group of capital structures, costs capitalized and included in Account 419.1 include both cost of debt and equity capital related to the construction of long-lived assets.</span>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-16" id="fn-16" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">Cheniere Creole Trail Pipeline, L.P., as a limited partnership, records net income in Account 211 Other-Paid-in-Capital.</span>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
