        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:107%">Other Deliveries includes Linepack and miscellaneous loss due to Blowdowns. (referenced on Line No. 40 and/or Line No.53 in Schedule 521).</span>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-26" id="fn-26" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">
      <span xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:107%">The value of the gas reported is based on an average monthly index price pursuant to the terms of our OBA agreements as described in our tariff. This footnote applies to all applicable amount columns reported within the quarter</span>
    </link:footnote>
